oning; no isolation feasible=>defer. Include safe snippets SETLOCK_TIMEOUT (notquerydeadline), sessioncontext, drivercommandtimeout and servercancel\/rollbackverify distinct, sessionID ownership notblindkill, resourcecapsbeforemonitoring, before\/during\/recovery SLOheadroom; SchS\/SchM vs datalocks\/versionstoreundo; longsnapshot\/versionstorepressure. Explain snapshotCOUNT semantics vs primarynow, noNsafe threshold, conditional TABLESAMPLE SYSTEM pagebias\/zero\/missing rows no10% guarantee, alternatives exact existingindex\/metadata separately maintainedcounter. All numbers must later come from results\/sqlserver; draft unmeasured untilowner evidence. Official Microsoftlinks for each technicalclaim. No MySQLnonlocking assumptions imported. Link newdocs from a separate sqlserver\/README if needed; root will update projectREADME afterfinaldocs.\nWrite a small author-result JSON list files, local syntax verification, ready command, concrete known unresolved points. Do not fabricate tests or measurements. Output your result as JSON object status, files, remaining.","systemPromptText":"Runtime variables are available under `runtimeVariables`. Use this JSON as the authoritative runtimeVariables object:\n`$rielaElidedKeys` lists message payload keys whose values equal the top-level runtimeVariables entry of the same name; `$rielaSameAs` points to an identical payload elsewhere in this object.\n{\"_rielaInput\":{\"communicationIds\":[],\"messages\":[],\"sourceStepIds\":[],\"stepId\":\"author\",\"workflowExecutionId\":\"sqlserver-count-review-session-35\"}}"},"lastBackendEventAt":"2026-11-07T22:59:54Z","lastBackendEventType":"agent_message_chunk","nodeId":"author","recentBackendEvents":[{"at":"2026-11-07T22:43:45Z","channel":"assistant","content":"既存ガイドと校正資料を確認し、SQL Server 用の独立した runner と日本語ガイドを実装します。DB・Docker・計測は起動せず、ローカルの構文検証まで行います。","eventType":"agent_message_chunk","sequence":1},{"at":"2026-11-07T22:44:39Z","channel":"assistant","content":"SQL Server では、partition DMV・